margin:0rem;color:#6750A4;margin-top:0rem;margin-bottom:0rem;margin-left:0rem;margin-right:0rem">PropertyIQ</p></td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="padding-right:2.5rem;padding-left:2.5rem;padding-bottom:1.5rem;padding-top:1.5rem"><tbody><tr><td><h1 style="font-size:1.25rem;line-height:1.4;font-weight:700;color:rgb(16,24,40);margin:0rem;margin-bottom:1rem">How to Read Your Scores</h1><p style="font-size:1rem;line-height:1.5rem;color:rgb(54,65,83);margin:0rem;margin-bottom:1rem;margin-top:0rem;margin-left:0rem;margin-right:0rem">Hey Sample,</p><p style="font-size:1rem;line-height:1.5rem;color:rgb(54,65,83);margin:0rem;margin-bottom:1rem;margin-top:0rem;margin-left:0rem;margin-right:0rem">Every market on PropertyIQ gets a <strong>PropertyIQ Score (1-99)</strong> that predicts which markets will outperform. Here&#x27;s how to read it:</p><p style="font-size:1rem;line-height:1.5rem;color:rgb(54,65,83);margin:0rem;margin-bottom:0.5rem;margin-top:0rem;margin-left:0rem;margin-right:0rem"><strong>Score 50 = state average.</strong> Higher means the market is predicted to outperform its state; lower means underperformance.</p><p style="font-size:1rem;line-height:1.5rem;color:rgb(54,65,83);margin:0rem;margin-bottom:0.5rem;margin-top:0rem;margin-left:0rem;margin-right:0rem">The PropertyIQ Score blends four demand signals: home-value momentum over the last 12 and 3 months (from Zillow), how fast homes are selling (median days on market), and the share of listings with price cuts (from Realtor).</p><p style="font-size:1rem;line-height:1.5rem;color:rgb(54,65,83);margin:0rem;margin-bottom:1rem;margin-top:0rem;margin-left:0rem;margin-right:0rem">Want the receipts? See how the score has performed against real market outcomes: <a href="https://example.com/scores/accuracy" style="color:rgb(103,80,164);text-decoration-line:underline" target="_blank">https://example.com/scores/accuracy</a></p><p style="font-size:1rem;line-height:1.5rem;color:rgb(54,65,83);margin:0rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;margin-top:0rem;margin-left:0rem;margin-right:0rem">Pick a market on the map and see your PropertyIQ Score:</p><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:1.5rem"><tbody><tr><td><a href="https://example.com/map" style="line-height:1.5;text-decoration:none;display:block;max-width:100%;mso-padding-alt:0px;background-color:rgb(103,80,164);color:rgb(255,255,255);font-size:1rem;font-weight:600;padding-bottom:12px;padding-top:12px;padding-right:32px;padding-left:32px;border-radius:0.5rem;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration-line:none;text-align:center" target="_blank"><span><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:400%;mso-text-raise:18" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;&#8202;&#8202;</i><![endif]--></span><span style="max-width:100%;display:inline-block;line-height:120%;mso-padding-alt:0px;mso-text-raise:9px">See Scores on the Map</span><span><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:400%" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;&#8202;&#8202;&#8203;</i><![endif]--></span></a></td></tr></tbody></table><p style="font-size:0.875rem;line-height:1.25rem;color:rgb(106,114,130);margin:0rem;margin-top:0rem;margin-bottom:0rem;margin-left:0rem;margin-right:0rem">If the button doesn&#x27;t work, copy this link: <a href="https://example.com/map" style="color:rgb(103,80,164);text-decoration-line:underline" target="_blank">https://example.com/map</a></p></td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="padding-right:2.5rem;padding-left:2.5rem;padding-top:1.5rem;padding-bottom:2rem;background-color:rgb(249,250,251);border-top:1px solid #e5e5e5"><tbody><tr><td><p style="font-size:0.75rem;line-height:1.25rem;color:rgb(153,161,175);margin:0rem;margin-top:0rem;margin-bottom:0rem;margin-left:0rem;margin-right:0rem">PropertyIQ</p><p style="font-size:0.75rem;line-height:1.3333333333333333;color:rgb(153,161,175);margin:0rem;margin-top:0.25rem;margin-bottom:0rem;margin-left:0rem;margin-right:0rem"><a href="https://example.com/account/notifications" style="color:rgb(153,161,175);text-decoration-line:underline" target="_blank">Unsubscribe</a> or <a href="https://propertyiq.app/account/notifications" style="color:rgb(153,161,175);text-decoration-line:underline" target="_blank">manage preferences</a></p><p style="font-size:0.75rem;line-height:1.3333333333333333;color:rgb(153,161,175);margin:0rem;margin-top:0.25rem;margin-bottom:0rem;margin-left:0rem;margin-right:0rem">© 2026 PropertyIQ. All rights reserved.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></body></html>"
