esentation" style="padding-right:2.5rem;padding-left:2.5rem;padding-bottom:1.5rem;padding-top:1.5rem"><tbody><tr><td><h1 style="font-size:1.25rem;line-height:1.4;font-weight:700;color:rgb(16,24,40);margin:0rem;margin-bottom:1rem">How Investors Use PropertyIQ</h1><p style="font-size:1rem;line-height:1.5rem;color:rgb(54,65,83);margin:0rem;margin-bottom:1rem;margin-top:0rem;margin-left:0rem;margin-right:0rem">Hey Sample,</p><p style="font-size:1rem;line-height:1.5rem;color:rgb(54,65,83);margin:0rem;margin-bottom:1rem;margin-top:0rem;margin-left:0rem;margin-right:0rem">Here&#x27;s how a typical PropertyIQ session goes for an investor looking for their next market:</p><p style="font-size:1rem;line-height:1.5rem;color:rgb(54,65,83);margin:0rem;margin-bottom:0.5rem;margin-top:0rem;margin-left:0rem;margin-right:0rem"><strong>Step 1:</strong> Open the map and filter by PropertyIQ Score &gt; 70. This removes markets with weak fundamentals immediately.</p><p style="font-size:1rem;line-height:1.5rem;color:rgb(54,65,83);margin:0rem;margin-bottom:0.5rem;margin-top:0rem;margin-left:0rem;margin-right:0rem"><strong>Step 2:</strong> Sort by rent-to-price ratio or score momentum to surface markets gaining ground fast.</p><p style="font-size:1rem;line-height:1.5rem;color:rgb(54,65,83);margin:0rem;margin-bottom:1.25rem;margin-top:0rem;margin-left:0rem;margin-right:0rem"><strong>Step 3:</strong> Drop 2–3 finalists into the comparison view. Side-by-side metrics, trends, and demographics. Pick the one.</p><p style="font-size:1rem;line-height:1.5rem;color:rgb(54,65,83);margin:0rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;margin-top:0rem;margin-left:0rem;margin-right:0rem">The whole process takes about 10 minutes. Give it a try:</p><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:1.25rem"><tbody><tr><td><a href="https://example.com/map" style="line-height:1.5;text-decoration:none;display:block;max-width:100%;mso-padding-alt: