;margin-left:0rem;margin-right:0rem">PropertyIQ</p></td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="padding-right:2.5rem;padding-left:2.5rem;padding-bottom:1.5rem;padding-top:1.5rem"><tbody><tr><td><h1 style="font-size:1.25rem;line-height:1.4;font-weight:700;color:rgb(16,24,40);margin:0rem;margin-bottom:1rem">Ready to Go Further?</h1><p style="font-size:1rem;line-height:1.5rem;color:rgb(54,65,83);margin:0rem;margin-bottom:1rem;margin-top:0rem;margin-left:0rem;margin-right:0rem">Hey Sample,</p><p style="font-size:1rem;line-height:1.5rem;color:rgb(54,65,83);margin:0rem;margin-bottom:1rem;margin-top:0rem;margin-left:0rem;margin-right:0rem">You&#x27;ve had a week to explore PropertyIQ. Here&#x27;s what free users can&#x27;t see yet:</p><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="margin-bottom:1.25rem"><tbody><tr><td><p style="font-size:0.875rem;line-height:1.25rem;color:rgb(54,65,83);margin:0rem;margin-bottom:0.5rem;margin-top:0rem;margin-left:0rem;margin-right:0rem">🔒 <strong>Score breakdowns</strong> — understand exactly why a market ranks the way it does</p><p style="font-size:0.875rem;line-height:1.25rem;color:rgb(54,65,83);margin:0rem;margin-bottom:0.5rem;margin-top:0rem;margin-left:0rem;margin-right:0rem">🔒 <strong>40+ data metrics</strong> — median DOM, price cuts, rent yield, cap rate, and more</p><p style="font-size:0.875rem;line-height:1.25rem;color:rgb(54,65,83);margin:0rem;margin-bottom:0.5rem;margin-top:0rem;margin-left:0rem;margin-right:0rem">🔒 <strong>AI market reports</strong> — plain-English summaries ready to share with partners or agents</p><p style="font-size:0.875rem;line-height:1.25rem;color:rgb(54,65,83);margin:0rem;margin-top:0rem;margin-bottom:0rem;margin-left:0rem;margin-right:0rem">🔒 <strong>Unlimited markets</strong> — no 5-market cap</p></td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:1.25rem"><tbody><tr><td><a href="https://example.com/pricing?from=email_day7" style="line-height:1.5;text-decoration:none;display:block;max-width:100%;mso-padding-alt:0px;background-color:rgb(103,80,164);color:rgb(255,255,255);font-size:1rem;font-weight:600;padding-bottom:12px;padding-top:12px;padding-right:32px;padding-left:32px;border-radius:0.5rem;box-sizing:border-box;text-decoration-line:none;text-align:center" target="_blank"><span><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:400%;mso-text-raise:18" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;&#8202;&#8202;</i><![endif]--></span><span style="max-width:100%;display:inline-block;line-height:120%;mso-padding-alt:0px;mso-text-raise:9px">Unlock Pro Access</span><span><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:400%" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;&#8202;&#8202;&#8203;</i><![endif]--></span></a></td></tr></tbody></table><p style="font-size:0.875rem;line-height:1.25rem;color:rgb(106,114,130);margin:0rem;margin-bottom:1rem;margin-top:0rem;margin-left:0rem;margin-right:0rem">Or, if you haven&#x27;t set up your preferences yet, take 60 seconds to tell us your goals and we&#x27;ll surface markets matched to you: <a href="https://example.com/onboarding" style="color:rgb(103,80,164);text-decoration-line:underline" target="_blank">Complete your profile</a></p><p style="font-size:0.875rem;line-height:1.25rem;color:rgb(106,114,130);margin:0rem;margin-top:0rem;margin-bottom:0rem;margin-left:0rem;margin-right:0rem">If the button doesn&#x27;t work, copy this link: <a href="https://example.com/pricing?from=email_day7" style="color:rgb(103,80,164);text-decoration-line:underline" target="_blank">https://example.com/pricing?from=email_day7</a></p></td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="padding-right:2.5rem;padding-left:2.5rem;padding-top:1.5rem;padding-bottom:2rem;background-color:rgb(249,250,251);border-top:1px solid #e5e5e5"><tbody><tr><td><p style="font-size:0.75rem;line-height:1.25rem;color:rgb(153,161,175);margin:0rem;margin-top:0rem;margin-bottom:0rem;margin-left:0rem;margin-right:0rem">PropertyIQ</p><p style="font-size:0.75rem;line-height:1.3333333333333333;color:rgb(153,161,175);margin:0rem;margin-top:0.25rem;margin-bottom:0rem;margin-left:0rem;margin-right:0rem"><a href="https://example.com/account/notifications" style="color:rgb(153,161,175);text-decoration-line:underline" target="_blank">Unsubscribe</a> or <a href="https://propertyiq.app/account/notifications" style="color:rgb(153,161,175);text-decoration-line:underline" target="_blank">manage preferences</a></p><p style="font-size:0.75rem;line-height:1.3333333333333333;color:rgb(153,161,175);margin:0rem;margin-top:0.25rem;margin-bottom:0rem;margin-left:0rem;margin-right:0rem">© 2026 PropertyIQ. All rights reserved.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></body></html>"
